    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This salad serves 4 as a side and takes 10 minutes to prepare and 15 minutes to cook. It is one of the simplest Moroccan cooked salads and one of the most satisfying, with the carrots absorbing the spiced dressing as they cool."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: The amount of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "harissa-term"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "harissa"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " varies widely between brands. Start with 1 tablespoon, taste after dressing the carrots and add more if you want extra heat. Rose harissa is a milder, more fragrant option if you prefer less fire."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
